  "project_description": "A COOKiES bridge submodule that registers a 'telegram' consent service and neutralizes Telegram media embeds provided by the telegram_media_type module until the visitor consents via the COOKiES banner, then re-activates them client-side. Contains no PHP classes, routes, permissions, or config schema of its own; it wires three hooks and one JS behavior into the COOKiES knock-out mechanism.",
